-msgstr "E<lt>I<språk>E<gt>[\\|B<_>E<lt>I<territorium>E<gt>\\|[\\|B<.>E<lt>I<teckenuppsättning>E<gt>\\|[\\|B<,>E<lt>I<version>E<gt>\\|]\\|]\\|]"
